    "subject": "One wall note screen with a draft visit note in an illustrated Houston exam room, the spoken word ribbon that becomes its draft line, the thread back to source words, the check slot and record tray, and the records around it: a school post card with a dashed platform outline and two pilot tags, a physician outline row with a refresher tag, a press release and system initiative card with an agreement thread, a framework with three institution cards, a bill card with an effective stamp, diagnosis frame and review condition, a visit note card with a question mark, and empty fields stamped not published",
    "note": "Fresh authored Claude-lane episode for 2026-11-10 (UT Physicians and Epic ambient listening, the Abridge and University of Texas System agreement of October 8th, 2026 and S.B. 1188). Hero NoteHero and support ClinicRecordSupport are original React and SVG groups shared by both treatments. A follows one note screen through a single exam room, B keeps the empty check slot in frame at the start of every scene. Disclosed illustration, no brand marks, no real clinic, clinician, patient, interface or seal.",
